{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13215170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13215170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1321517001:0":{"text":"ガリ、ここですね？","source_cn":"你说的是这个位置吗，伽利？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB088CFF0A0A498E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321517002:0":{"text":"うん、そうだ！さすが長年のパートナー、言わずもがなだね！","source_cn":"没错，就是那里！咱们还是一如既往地有默契！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC87E4896A3EAE873","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321517003:1":{"text":"じゃあ、ここで待ってますね。あなたたちは早く怪しい売り主の探索を。","source_cn":"好吧，你们快去找那些可疑的家伙吧。我在这里等你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEE46A0B1308291F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321517004:0":{"text":"任せてください！すぐに見つけて戻ってきます！","source_cn":"放心吧，我们很快就回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07BDD6F156ABA1BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321517005:0":{"text":"警備隊の配置も大丈夫だ。","source_cn":"我也会带人提前守好这里，不用担心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62D4E0C150752E78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321517006:0":{"text":"そうだ、メリッサ！いかにも発掘したかのような形跡を残しておくように。それに副葬品っぽいものも置いておくといいね。確かこの前、学会から遺物の模型をいくつか……","source_cn":"哦，对了！梅丽莎，记得要用铲子松一松周围的土，制造出被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC9FB5C34EB0E91B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321517007:0":{"text":"はいはい、分かってますよ。そんなに言われなくても、私も考古学者なんですからね！","source_cn":"知道了知道了，不用交代这么多，我又不是第一次考古……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AF33276CCA32914","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321517008:0":{"text":"はぁ……あなたと組んだのは、幸運なのか不幸なのか……","source_cn":"唉，真不知道和你搭档是我的幸运还是我的不幸……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6BC69DAC109A79A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:梅丽莎":{"text":"メリッサ","source":"梅丽莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伽利":{"text":"ガリ","source":"伽利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:公国卫队长":{"text":"公国警備隊隊長","source":"公国卫队长","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":4}}